10
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:09,240
Wasn't that case closed long ago?

11
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:11,480
Why would he investigate it again?

12
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:17,840
Any lie requires more lies to cover it up,

13
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:20,800
but if it can't be fixed,

14
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,040
the only solution is to kill.

15
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,120
For us,

16
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:27,960
