24
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:49,000
But no matter how weak they are,

25
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,520
Lu Yuanyuan might not have that skill.

26
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:54,920
Don't get your hopes up.

27
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:55,840
Besides,

28
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:59,080
