29
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:01,640
Don't let anyone catch anything against us.

30
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:05,680
Of course.

31
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:10,360
Want to have some fun?

32
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:43,640
Zizhou.

33
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,280
Did that redhead

34
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:46,640
