38
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,720
We have to be cautious.

39
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:55,200
Okay.

40
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:56,040
Zizhou.

41
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:57,960
I'll go up and wait for Mom and Dad.

42
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,360
You'll go find Dr. Yu.

43
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:01,240
After daybreak,

44
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:04,040
