46
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:07,040
What?

47
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:08,720
Hasn't Xiaoxiao woken up yet?

48
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:09,760
Who is that person?

49
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:15,320
It's Xiaoxiao's twin sister,

50
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:16,280
Lily.

51
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:19,000
Xiaoxiao hasn't been revived yet,

52
00:04:19,880 --> 00:04:20,920
