53
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:23,160
She's been hidden safely by Yu Jinning.

54
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:27,400
Zizhou.

55
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,680
When I was holding Xiaoxiao,

56
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,880
