She's the daughter of Xie Zhengyan,

66
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:55,600
Chairman of Zhengyan Group, and his ex-wife Huo Jia.

67
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,880
At Zhengyan Bay Hospital,

68
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:01,240
the person who sent you the warning using Xiaoxiao's phone

69
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:02,680
