70
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:04,280
It was also her

71
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:07,160
who pulled the switch in the hospital corridor.

72
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:08,560
Lily?

73
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:10,840
That fierce woman

74
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:12,480
you saved on Wulai Island

75
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:14,520
