76
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:46,720
Victor said,

77
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:47,400
Take her alive.

78
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,040
Okay.

79
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:18,120
Run now!

80
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,920
Find her now!

81
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:46,520
We must find that dangerous Nightblade.

82
00:06:46,520 --> 00:06:46,960
