87
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:05,120
- I'm Lily, from ISA Medical Team Three. - Xiaoxiao...

88
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:06,440
And you?

89
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:08,600
I'm Nightblade, from Rescue Team One.

90
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:10,480
Our people are coming soon.

91
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:11,800
Leave the rest

92
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:12,840
