93
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:43,880
Yan Sir.

94
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:50,960
- Xiaoxiao? - Xiaoxiao?

95
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:52,600
This is Lily.

96
00:07:53,960 --> 00:07:55,760
You two continue the mission.

97
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,920
Song Ke and I will take her leave.

98
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:02,640
Xiaoquan.

99
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:04,680
Maybe

100
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:07,760
