117
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,640
Any exit record?

118
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:56,280
And who is currently in charge of the group now?

119
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:58,560
I'll go to the airport immigration office right away to find out.

120
00:09:58,840 --> 00:09:59,360
Bai Sir.

121
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:02,360
Currently, He Huan,

122
00:10:02,560 --> 00:10:03,920
Chairman Xie's wife is in charge

123
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:05,040
