124
00:10:05,520 --> 00:10:06,360
He Huan?

125
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:08,560
Got it.

126
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:09,800
Remember,

127
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:12,160
