128
00:10:12,400 --> 00:10:13,600
Don't alert anyone.

129
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:14,560
Got it.

130
00:10:15,040 --> 00:10:16,680
I won't mention Chairman Xie.

131
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:18,480
Xiaoquan.

132
00:11:19,920 --> 00:11:20,440
Xiaoquan.

133
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:20,840
Mom.

134
00:11:20,880 --> 00:11:21,480
Xiaoquan.

135
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:30,400
The driver just picked your dad and me up from home.

136
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:31,320
How is Xiaoxiao

137
