155
00:13:03,800 --> 00:13:05,600
Don't worry.

156
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,280
Xiaoxiao is still alive.

157
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:10,360
During her fall,

158
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:11,880
