163
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:21,160
Xiaoxiao!

164
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:24,880
Xiaoxiao.

165
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:27,560
Xiaoxiao.

166
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:31,080
You have to hang on.

167
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:31,960
Xiaoxiao.

168
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:32,640
Xiaoxiao.

169
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,680
I'm here to see you.

170
00:13:36,760 --> 00:13:37,880
Xiaoxiao.

171
00:13:42,160 --> 00:13:43,640
My daughter.

172
00:13:44,640 --> 00:13:46,040
I'm here.

173
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:47,040
Xiaoxiao.

174
00:13:47,640 --> 00:13:48,920
You have to hang on.

175
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:57,880
Dr. Yu,

176
00:13:58,560 --> 00:14:00,400
