181
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:08,200
She can't handle any more stress.

182
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,240
Rest assured, you two.

183
00:14:10,680 --> 00:14:11,680
But from now on,

184
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:14,200
