187
00:14:20,560 --> 00:14:21,720
Good that she is alive.

188
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:25,360
Our family can't afford to lose anyone else.

189
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:27,800
Over the past eighteen years,

190
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:31,520
