191
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:37,440
Uncle.

192
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:39,680
Shanchen!

193
00:14:40,400 --> 00:14:41,040
What's wrong?

194
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:41,760
Shanchen!

195
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:43,880
Shanchen!

196
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:46,440
Doctor.

197
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:48,160
